{"title":"Ashsworn Acolyte","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 57 Ashsworn that attacks with burn (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-acolyte\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-acolyte?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>47</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-acolyte?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>87</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-acolyte?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-acolyte?lv=60\">Lv 60 <span>36</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-acolyte?lv=61\">Lv 61 <span>47</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-acolyte?lv=57\" title=\"Pick level 57\"><td><b>57</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>406</td><td>35.9</td><td>2,850</td><td class=\"muted\">1,218 · 50.3 · 8,550</td><td>47</td><td>in the wilds around 219, -1116</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-acolyte?lv=58\" title=\"Pick level 58\"><td><b>58</b></td><td>423</td><td>36.4</td><td>2,900</td><td class=\"muted\">1,269 · 51 · 8,700</td><td>87</td><td>in the wilds around 258, -1103</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-acolyte?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>2</td><td>in the wilds around 286, -1119</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-acolyte\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>60</b></td><td>455</td><td>37.5</td><td>3,000</td><td class=\"muted\">1,365 · 52.5 · 9,000</td><td>36</td><td>in the wilds around 300, -1192</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-acolyte?lv=61\" title=\"Pick level 61\"><td><b>61</b></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td>47</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"ashsworn-acolyte\" data-map-level=\"60\">Show level 60 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 10 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 15 recorded drops, 1,475 total, 35–508 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×35–508</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ash-charm\" title=\"Ash Charm - in 7 of 10 looted corpses, 7 recorded drops, 7 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/f82a451885528bc6a9e6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ash Charm</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.4<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-spear\" title=\"Titanium Spear - in 1 of 10 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/025903982d7f079cd8a5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Spear</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/10<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 1 of 10 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/10<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-battlespear\" title=\"Titanium Battlespear - in 1 of 10 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c4ab2830d321dfc2bed7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Battlespear</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/10<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Shoddy: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"banked-ember\" title=\"Banked Ember - in 1 of 10 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/676a046c065d71a85ae7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Banked Ember</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/10<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Molten Heart</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 47</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6304\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=